---
import { ArrowRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="mx-auto px-6 py-10" style="max-width: var(--content-max);">
  <div class="reveal">
    <h2 class="section-label">About</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-serif text-xl leading-relaxed text-ink sm:text-2xl">
      I came to research from production. My questions start as incidents: retrieval that misses
      the second hop, evals that stay green while the system gets worse, agents that succeed by
      accident. I study them with a stated hypothesis, a fixed setup and an interval on every
      number, and I publish the null results too.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-faint">
      Research interests · retrieval over structured knowledge · LLM evaluation methodology · agent
      reliability
    </p>
    <a
      href="/about"
      class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[var(--color-accent-hover)]"
    >
      More about me <ArrowRight size={15} stroke-width={2} />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
